# I must in Russian: я до́лжен
subtitle: "Say I must in Russian with я до́лжен, я должна́, мы должны́, see how it differs from мне на́до, and turn it round with не до́лжен."
tags: ["russian","должен","must in russian","russian grammar","modal verbs"]
teaches: ["phrases/can-and-must"]
thumb: "band \"Must? Depends who's saying it\""
voices: {"a":"gemini:Achird | Tom, a warm, easy-going English speaker who knows Russian well; friendly with Masha, clear and unhurried; says Russian words the way a native Russian speaker would","b":"gemini:Leda | a friendly young Russian woman from Moscow, natural and lively, speaks English with a light Russian accent and says Russian words natively; never exaggerated"}
next: {"title":"If and would in Russian: е́сли, бы","href":"https://www.drawcast.app/#gh=hmelberg/drawcast-library/russian-from-zero/68-russian-conditional.cast"}

## I must in Russian: я до́лжен
level: basic

    icon tom size 140 set twemoji x 900 y 450 or ["person"] icon_look picture of man hidden true
    text tom_name "Tom" #8f887c x 900 y 340 font_size 32 hidden true
    text k0 "Мне ну́жно рабо́тать." say "Мне ну́жно рабо́тать." x 480 y 620 font_size 60 hidden true
    icon masha size 140 set twemoji x 100 y 450 or ["girl"] icon_look picture of woman hidden true
    text masha_name "Masha" #8f887c x 100 y 340 font_size 32 hidden true
    icon balloon_t size 90 set twemoji x 700 y 330 or ["right anger bubble"] icon_look picture of "speech balloon" hidden true
    icon balloon size 90 set twemoji x 290 y 330 or ["right anger bubble"] icon_look picture of "speech balloon" hidden true
    glossed s1 "Я должна́ прочита́ть кни́гу." say_voice b gloss ["","must","",""] show_gloss under x 500 y 450 font_size 60 hidden true
    icon b_f_i size 110 set twemoji x 120 y 580 or ["girl"] icon_look picture of woman hidden true
    text b_f_p "я" say я x 500 y 580 font_size 64 hidden true
    text b_f "должна́" say "я должна́" say_voice b colors {"а$":"#b5482e"} x 700 y 580 font_size 64 hidden true
    text b_f_h "свобо́дна" #8f887c x 905 y 580 font_size 32 hidden true
    icon b_m_i size 110 set twemoji x 120 y 440 or ["person"] icon_look picture of man hidden true
    text b_m_p "я" say я x 500 y 440 font_size 64 hidden true
    text b_m "до́лжен" say "я до́лжен" x 700 y 440 font_size 64 hidden true
    text b_m_h "свобо́ден" #8f887c x 905 y 440 font_size 32 hidden true
    icon b_p_i size 110 set twemoji x 120 y 300 or ["two women holding hands","family"] icon_look picture of "people holding hands" hidden true
    text b_p_p "мы · вы · они́" say "мы, вы, они́" x 390 y 300 font_size 50 hidden true
    text b_p "должны́" say "мы должны́" colors {"ы$":"#3f7f4f"} x 700 y 300 font_size 64 hidden true
    group board members ["b_f_i","b_f_p","b_f","b_m_i","b_m_p","b_m","b_p_i","b_p_p","b_p"] hidden true

A: How else can you say I have to, in Russian? You know мне ну́жно рабо́тать from lesson thirty-five.
    draw tom tom_name k0

A: Today, a must that starts from я and changes with who must. (@draw masha masha_name@) Listen first: I ask Masha about tonight.
    highlight k0 color #c9871a part ^Мне effect underline

    erase k0

A: Ма́ша, ты свобо́дна сего́дня ве́чером?
    draw balloon_t caption false

    erase balloon_t

    draw balloon

    ask "What does she have to do?" voice b options ["work","read a book","phone her mum"] correct 2
        gloss: No, I have to read a book.
        listen: Нет, я должна́ прочита́ть кни́гу.
        right: Read a book: прочита́ть кни́гу.
        wrong: Listen to the end: кни́гу.

    erase balloon

    hide tom tom_name masha masha_name

    draw s1

A: Должна́ is new: must. After it comes a verb from the dictionary: прочита́ть, read it to the end.
    highlight s1_w_2 color #c9871a effect underline

    erase s1

A: Masha says должна́, with a woman's а, as in свобо́дна.
    draw b_f_i b_f_p b_f b_f_h

    highlight b_f color #b5482e part а$

A: I say я до́лжен: no а, and an е slips in, as in свобо́ден.
    draw b_m_i b_m_p b_m b_m_h

    highlight b_m color #c9871a part ен$ effect underline

B: And the stress moves: до́лжен, but должна́.
    highlight b_m b_f color #c9871a effect underline

    erase b_f_h b_m_h

    draw b_p_i b_p_p

    quiz "Now guess: we must. Мы … ?" store chk voice a
        right: Должны́: for more than one, the ы of столы́.
        wrong: More than one of us: think of the ы in столы́.
        + должны́
        * должна́
        * до́лжен

A: Мы должны́, они́ должны́. And вы always takes должны́, even to one person.
    draw b_p

    hide board

B: So now you have two musts: мне на́до рабо́тать, я до́лжен рабо́тать.
    text c_l1 "Мне на́до рабо́тать." say "Мне на́до рабо́тать." x 250 y 600 font_size 42
    text c_r1 "Я до́лжен рабо́тать." say "Я до́лжен рабо́тать." x 750 y 600 font_size 42

A: На́до never changes; the person goes in as a to-word: мне, ей, нам.
    text c_l2p "ей" say "ей на́до" x 255 y 470 font_size 52
    text c_l2 "на́до" x 360 y 470 font_size 52
    text c_l3p "нам" say "нам на́до" x 240 y 370 font_size 52
    text c_l3 "на́до" x 360 y 370 font_size 52

    highlight c_l2p c_l3p color #c9871a effect underline

A: До́лжен starts from the person and changes to match: она́ должна́, мы должны́.
    text c_r2p "она́" say "она́ должна́" x 650 y 470 font_size 52
    text c_r2 "должна́" colors {"а$":"#b5482e"} x 810 y 470 font_size 52
    text c_r3p "мы" say "мы должны́" x 650 y 370 font_size 52
    text c_r3 "должны́" colors {"ы$":"#3f7f4f"} x 810 y 370 font_size 52

B: They mean nearly the same; до́лжен sounds a little more like a duty, or a promise.
    text c_duty "duty · promise" #8f887c x 730 y 260 font_size 40

    erase c_l1 c_r1 c_l2p c_l2 c_l3p c_l3 c_r2p c_r2 c_r3p c_r3 c_duty

A: Put не in front, and it turns round: you shouldn't.
    icon sick size 130 set twemoji x 500 y 560 or ["sneezing face"] icon_look picture of "face with thermometer"
    text n_ne "не до́лжен" say "не до́лжен" x 500 y 400 font_size 80

    erase n_ne

B: Тебе́ пло́хо? Ты не до́лжен сего́дня рабо́тать.
    text n1 "Тебе́ пло́хо?" say "Тебе́ пло́хо?" say_voice b x 500 y 420 font_size 56
    text n2 "Ты не до́лжен сего́дня рабо́тать." say "Ты не до́лжен сего́дня рабо́тать." say_voice b x 500 y 310 font_size 56

    highlight n2 color #c9871a part "не до́лжен" effect underline

    erase sick n1 n2

A: Now the whole conversation. Listen, then practise it.
    show masha masha_name tom tom_name

    dialogue talk speakers.a tom speakers.b masha turns [{"by":"a","text":"Ма́ша, ты свобо́дна сего́дня ве́чером?","gloss":"Masha, are you free this evening?"},{"by":"b","text":"Нет, я должна́ прочита́ть кни́гу.","gloss":"No, I have to read a book."},{"by":"a","text":"А за́втра? Дава́й пойдём в кино́!","gloss":"And tomorrow? Let's go to the cinema!"},{"by":"b","text":"За́втра я учу́сь весь день. А в суббо́ту?","gloss":"Tomorrow I'm studying all day. And on Saturday?"},{"by":"a","text":"В суббо́ту я свобо́ден. Но в воскресе́нье я до́лжен рабо́тать.","gloss":"On Saturday I'm free. But on Sunday I have to work."},{"by":"b","text":"Хорошо́! Дава́й в суббо́ту!","gloss":"Good! Let's make it Saturday!"}] practice true size 1.4

    draw talk

    draw talk

    draw talk

    draw talk

    draw talk

    erase talk

    hide masha masha_name tom tom_name

    icon q_work size 170 set twemoji x 500 y 480 or ["woman technologist","woman"] icon_look picture of "woman office worker"

    quiz "A woman says she has to work: Я ___ рабо́тать. Which word fills the gap?" reveal.text "Я должна́ рабо́тать." reveal.at.x 500 reveal.at.y 300 reveal.style label reveal.size 64 reveal.color #3d3833 voice b test t1
        intro: Five questions now, then your score.
        right: Должна́: a woman, so the а.
        wrong: A woman speaking: the а of свобо́дна.
        * должны́
        * до́лжен
        + должна́

    erase q_work

    icon q_walk size 160 set twemoji x 500 y 480 or ["person walking"] icon_look picture of "man walking"

    quiz "A man says: Мне на́до идти́. Which says the same?" reveal.text "Я до́лжен идти́." reveal.at.x 500 reveal.at.y 300 reveal.style label reveal.size 64 reveal.color #3d3833 voice a test t1
        right: Я до́лжен: до́лжен takes я; на́до takes мне.
        wrong: На́до goes with мне; до́лжен goes with я.
        + Я до́лжен идти́.
        * Мне до́лжен идти́.
        * Я на́до идти́.

    erase q_walk

    icon q_sick size 160 set twemoji x 500 y 480 or ["sneezing face"] icon_look picture of "face with thermometer"

    quiz "What does Ты не до́лжен сего́дня рабо́тать mean?" say_answer false reveal.text "You shouldn't work today." reveal.at.x 500 reveal.at.y 300 reveal.style label reveal.size 64 reveal.color #3d3833 voice b test t1
        right: Не до́лжен: you shouldn't.
        wrong: До́лжен is must; не turns it round.
        * You don't work today.
        + You shouldn't work today.
        * You can work today.

    erase q_sick

    icon q_office size 170 set twemoji x 500 y 480 or ["man technologist","man"] icon_look picture of "man office worker"

    ask "A man is asked out for Sunday, but he can't. Say it for him." voice a show cue test t1
        gloss: As a man: On Sunday I have to work.
        say_it: В воскресе́нье я до́лжен рабо́тать.

A: В воскресе́нье я до́лжен рабо́тать.
    text q_say "В воскресе́нье я до́лжен рабо́тать." say "В воскресе́нье я до́лжен рабо́тать." x 500 y 300 font_size 46

    erase q_office q_say

    icon q_books size 150 set twemoji x 400 y 480 or ["closed book"] icon_look picture of books
    icon q_two size 150 set twemoji x 620 y 480 or ["family"] icon_look picture of "people holding hands"

    ask "Now build a whole sentence. Type: We must study." answer ["мы должны учиться","должны учиться"] reveal.text "Мы должны́ учи́ться." reveal.at.x 500 reveal.at.y 300 reveal.style label reveal.size 64 reveal.color #3d3833 voice b test t1
        keys "АБВГДЕЁЖЗИЙКЛМНОПРСТУФХЦЧШЩЪЫЬЭЮЯ "
        right: Мы должны́ учи́ться: мы takes должны́, and учи́ться keeps its ся.
        wrong: Start with мы, then must for more than one, then to study: учи́ться.

    erase q_books q_two

    show board

A: You got {t1.score} of {t1.total}.
    results test t1 retry true pass 4

A: So до́лжен changes with whoever must: я до́лжен, я должна́, мы должны́. На́до stays as it is, with мне.
    highlight b_f b_m b_p color #c9871a effect underline

    hide board

B: Я должна́ прочита́ть кни́гу! Пока́!
    icon end_masha size 170 set twemoji x 380 y 470 or ["girl"] icon_look picture of woman
    icon end_book size 140 set twemoji x 620 y 470 or ["books"] icon_look picture of "closed book"
    text end_say "Я должна́ прочита́ть кни́гу!" say "Я должна́ прочита́ть кни́гу!" say_voice b colors {"а$":"#b5482e"} x 500 y 290 font_size 60

    erase end_masha end_book end_say

A: Next time: е́сли and бы, if and would.
    box next68 "Next: lesson 68 · е́сли, бы" say "е́сли, бы" x 500 y 430 width 600 height 130 radius 14 font_size 44

